sc.manual.energy.padhead=Charge pads
sc.manual.energy.pad.1=As in IC2: an energy storage with a charge pad on top - same buffer, slot and output. Stand on it and it charges the worn armour, then the item in hand, then blades and weapons in the inventory (with IC2 - any IC2 item too), up to its tier's voltage per tick in all, slot included. Only items of its tier or lower: %s. The pad glows while it charges.
# regeneration
sc.armorfn.regeneration=Regeneration
sc.armorfn.regeneration.desc=Combat mode only: heals every second while you are hurt (Nano +0.5 HP, Quantum +1 HP, Exo +2 HP; 200 EU/s before multipliers - 900 EU/s in combat mode with regeneration on, 675 EU/s with the full Nano set). While it is on the whole suit - functions, absorbing damage and chips - costs 3 times as much as in plain combat mode
sc.armorhud.regen=Regeneration: energy x3
