sc.manual.armor.drillshead=Electric drills
sc.manual.armor.drills.1=There are drills for the Nano, Quantum, Exo and Singular suits, after IC2's drills: pickaxe and shovel at once, EU per block, no wear. The battery is small - the drill is meant for the energy suit: while a chestplate is worn the drill takes what it lacks from it, and the chestplate's weapon charger tops it up. Every drill does all the one below it does; the Singular one also has levels, the black hole mode and functions of its own (its own article).
sc.manual.armor.drills.2=Functions and their keys are in the "Drill" tab of the armour screen (K); without armour the screen opens with just that tab. The drill's heat is its own, shown on the left under the suit's lines; overheated it doesn't dig until cooled to half. The Nano drill is crafted, Quantum and Exo come from the Upgrade Station keeping charge and settings.
