sc.manual.machines.wrenchhead=Wrenches
sc.manual.machines.wrench.1=Wrench (steel): right-click turns a machine, generator, storage or transformer a quarter turn, sneak + right-click faces it to the clicked side; it also sets cable and pipe sides. Other mods' wrenches work too.
sc.manual.machines.wrench.2=The Electric Wrench (LV, 10,000 EU) adds Dismantle mode (sneak + right-click in the air): a block of the mod goes straight into the inventory with its charge, fuel and fluids, 250 EU. Cables, pipes and pneumatic tubes come off one part at a time - the one under the cursor (a tenth of the price). Another player's private field zone won't let you take blocks.
sc.manual.machines.wrench.3=Quantum Wrench (HV, 100,000 EU): dismantles from afar - right-click in the air at a block up to 8 blocks away (500 EU); Copy settings mode, like IC2's memory card: sneak + right-click remembers a field generator's settings (shape, range, functions, colour), a transformer's mode or a machine's upgrade set, right-click applies them to another such block - upgrades come from your inventory.
