sc.manual.machine.electric_furnace=Electric Furnace: smelts everything a furnace smelts (other mods' recipes too), twice as fast and without fuel - 4 EU/t, 5 s a piece. The experience stays in the furnace: the Take XP button on its screen; breaking it spills the orbs.
sc.manual.machine.induction_furnace=Induction Furnace: two pieces at once (the left and the right column of slots). It heats up while it works: x1 cold, x3 hot (fully hot in about 50 seconds), and cools when idle. The Warm button holds it hot with nothing in for 8 EU/t (with the redstone mode - on a signal). Experience is kept as in the electric furnace.
