sc.manual.generator.singular_reactor=A tiny black hole in a 7x7x5 build, held by 16 gravity coils. Lit by a 700 million EU charge from its port storages, fed with compressed matter capsules, cooled by liquid helium. Its output follows the hole's mass: 131,072 EU/t in the 40-70% window, up to 196,608 EU/t from a light hole. Without the whole build the screen opens but it can't be lit - the screen says what is missing.
