sc.manual.generator.sing.feedhead=Capsule feed and "Auto"
sc.manual.generator.sing.feed.1="Auto" (on from the start) holds the mass near 55% by itself: it feeds what the hole loses and adds more when it is lighter.
sc.manual.generator.sing.feed.2=With "Auto" off capsules go in at a fixed pace: Economy - a capsule per 10 min (the mass slowly falls), Normal - per 7.5 min (holds about 55%, but drifts if left alone), Overdrive - per 5 min (the mass rises). A light hole evaporates faster, so the balance is unstable - watch the mass graph and change the mode.
sc.manual.generator.sing.feed.3=Without capsules the mass falls: from 55% to evaporation takes about 20 minutes. Over 98% the injector feeds nothing.
sc.manual.generator.sing.accidenthead=Containment and accidents
sc.manual.generator.sing.accident.1=Containment (0-100%) falls without helium (-4/s), without deuterium (-2/s), with the build broken (-10/s) and for a light hole under 20% (-1/s); otherwise it recovers 2/s. At 40% and 20% - warnings in chat and on the screen. Under 10% the reactor puts the hole out with 1000 mB of argon from a tank - a soft stop.
sc.armorfn.grav_flight=Gravitational flight
sc.armorfn.grav_flight.desc=Singular flight instead of the usual one: 3 times the Exo speed, no inertia - let go of the keys and the suit stops and hovers at once. Helium 1 mB/s and 2000 EU/s while flying, no hydrogen. Needs helium; below 10% chestplate charge it switches off (soft descent)
sc.armorfn.magnet=Magnet
sc.armorfn.magnet.desc=Pulls items and experience within 8 blocks to you. What you threw yourself is left alone for a second. Helium 1 mB/min, 20 EU/s
sc.armorfn.grav_anchor=Gravitational anchor
sc.armorfn.grav_anchor.desc=Hits don't knock you back, explosions don't move you (the damage still comes). Heavy water 1 mB per push stopped. Switches off below 10% leggings charge
sc.armorfn.stabilizer=Stabilizer
sc.armorfn.stabilizer.desc=Cobwebs and soul sand don't slow you down. Argon 0.5 mB/s, only while you're in them
sc.armorfn.antigrav=Antigravity
sc.armorfn.antigrav.desc=After 3 blocks of free fall you fall slowly and take no damage (sneak to fall freely). Plus a jump in mid-air: jump again while airborne, once until you land. Slow fall - hydrogen 0.5 mB/s and 100 EU/s, the jump - 10 mB of hydrogen and 5000 EU. It replaces the boost's air jump, the two never stack
sc.armorfn.void_rescue=Void rescue
sc.armorfn.void_rescue.desc=Fell into the void (below height 0) - the suit puts you back where you last stood firmly in this world (none - at the spawn point), the landing does no damage. Helium 500 mB and 10% of the suit's charge, heat +50, cooldown 5 minutes
sc.armorfn.grav_strike=Gravitational strike
sc.armorfn.grav_strike.desc=The fall damage the boots took off hits hostile mobs within 4 blocks as a shockwave: 1 damage per point taken off, and a throw back. The higher you fell, the harder the blow (with antigravity, sneak to fall freely). Hydrogen 1 mB and heat +1 per point
sc.armorfn.wither_void=Wither and void resistance
sc.armorfn.wither_void.desc=Needs all four Singular pieces. Wither is taken off at once (oxygen 2 mB each time), the void hurts half as much
sc.armorfn.clear_sight=Glare-free night vision
sc.armorfn.clear_sight.desc=Night vision that goes out in bright light (light level 12 and up) and comes back in the dark - no glare. Takes over the helmet's usual night vision while on. Krypton 1 mB/min, 40 EU/s
sc.armorfn.heat_vent=Emergency heat vent
sc.armorfn.heat_vent.desc=When the heat reaches 100%, instead of overheating the suit throws the heat out: a wave throws back and sets on fire the mobs within 5 blocks, the heat halves. Argon 200 mB, cooldown 1 minute. On cooldown or without argon - the usual overheat
sc.armorfn.event_horizon=Event horizon
sc.armorfn.event_horizon.desc=Projectiles (arrows, fireballs, thrown things) vanish before they reach you: helium 5 mB and heat +2 each. 30% of other damage turns into the suit's energy (8000 EU per point), helium 1 mB per damage point. While it works it replaces the energy shield. Switches off below 10% chestplate charge
sc.armorfn.phase_dash=Phase dash
sc.armorfn.phase_dash.desc=On its key - an instant jump up to 16 blocks along your look (on the ground looking down - along the ground). Never through walls: it stops before the first obstacle, never into lava. Hydrogen 50 mB and 50 000 EU, heat +10, cooldown 3 seconds
sc.manual.generator.sing.accident.2=Without argon at zero - an ejection: for 5 seconds the hole pulls items, mobs and players within 8 blocks (no harm), then vanishes in a flash of radiation, 25 out to 24 blocks for a minute, and throws 2-4 coils out as items. Mass under 5% - evaporation: a flash of 30 out to 32 blocks for a minute, the coils whole. The world isn't broken.
sc.manual.generator.sing.accident.3=After any accident or stop the reactor won't light by itself - press "Allow lighting".
sc.manual.generator.sing.radhead=Radiation
sc.manual.generator.sing.rad.1=A running hole radiates by its mass: from 6 out to 16 blocks (heavy) to 16 out to 30 blocks (light), 9 out to 20 in the window. The lead shell holds the normal radiation. The flashes of an ejection or evaporation go through any wall, lead too.
sc.manual.generator.sing.screenhead=The reactor's screen
sc.manual.generator.sing.screen.1=On the left - the hole in its coil rings (pulsing faster the lighter it is), the mass scale with the 40-70% window, containment, Hawking temperature and the last minute's mass; before lighting - the readiness checklist. In the middle - the build by its five layers with the ports (He, D, Ar, E - a storage) and the "Light", "Stop", "Feed", "Auto" buttons. On the right - the port tanks, the capsule slot with its injector and the storages. Below - the status lines and a summary: output a minute, how long the capsules, helium and deuterium last.
sc.gui.sing.st.offrun=Switched off: the hole lives on and eats fuel - press "Stop" to put it out
sc.gui.comp.hint.2=§7Refused: fluid buckets, the mod's machines, rare and valuable things (diamonds, nether stars...)
sc.armorfn.booster=Engine boost
sc.armorfn.booster.desc=Hydrogen from the chestplate and boots: flight twice as fast with no EU (2 mB/s), the Exo dash half as far again (50 mB instead of EU), a second jump in mid-air with jump boots (20 mB), a soft landing with no damage (30 mB). Without hydrogen everything works as usual
sc.armorfn.searchlight=Searchlight
sc.armorfn.searchlight.desc=The helmet's krypton lamp lights up where you look, up to 12 blocks ahead. 1 mB of krypton a minute. Does nothing without krypton
sc.armorfn.fusion_cell=Micro fusion cell
sc.armorfn.fusion_cell.desc=Burns the chestplate's deuterium (2 mB/s) and gives the suit 256 EU/t. Heats hard, helium goes twice as fast. Goes out without helium in the loop
