sc.armorStation.tooltip=Fills energy armour with gases from the tanks beside it and charges it (MV)
sc.armorStation.details=Four armour slots and four upgrade slots. Fills its own tanks from pipes and the tanks beside it on any side: up to %d mB a tick of each gas; the armour is filled out of the tanks, 1 EU per %d mB. Charges any of the mod's suits (Nano, Quantum, Exo) at the input voltage: MV, higher with a Transformer. Stand on it to fill and charge the armour you wear.
sc.armorStation.howto=Put gas tanks next to it or run a pipe in, feed it MV power. Put the armour in the slots or stand on the station. The screen has a check box per gas and the switches.
