sc.manual.armor.strict.head=Gases for the functions: Quantum, Exo and Singular
sc.manual.armor.strict.1=The Quantum, Exo and Singular suits run on gases: each function switches on only with its own gas in the worn suit, and spends a little of it while it works. Without the gas the function stays off, and its row in the armour menu (K) is grey, with a tip naming the missing gas.
sc.manual.armor.strict.2=Nano is softer: the only gas it needs is oxygen to breathe, the other Nano functions run on energy alone. Hydrogen moves you, helium runs the suit, oxygen is for breathing and cleansing, krypton for sight, argon against fire, heavy water against radiation.
