sc.manual.armor.emergency.head=Emergency mode
sc.manual.armor.emergency.1=With no helium in a Quantum, Exo or Singular loop (or no chestplate on) the suit goes into emergency mode: every function but the HUD is off, the solar film doesn't charge, and the plating protects no better than iron. A red line shows on the HUD and in the armour menu, and a warning comes in chat.
sc.manual.armor.emergency.2=Refill helium at a service station or from a cell or bucket on the Life support tab of the K menu - the functions come back at once.
sc.gas.warn.hydrogen=Hydrogen: under 30 seconds of flight left. Refill it at the Armour Service Station
