sc.tooltip.armor.loop=The helium loop is in the chestplate: without a chestplate with helium worn this piece is in emergency mode (iron-grade protection, functions off)
sc.tooltip.armor.loop.chest=The helium loop is in this chestplate: without it Quantum and Exo pieces are in emergency mode (iron-grade protection, functions off)
