sc.manual.armor.strict.3=Hydrogen in flight: when there's less than 30 seconds of it left, a warning comes in chat (again after a refill). If the gas runs out in mid-air (no hydrogen, or under 1% helium in the loop), the flight is cut, but for 5 seconds the fall is slowed and that landing does no damage. A dash needs at least 50 mB of hydrogen, a soft landing 1 mB for each damage point it takes off.
sc.manual.armor.emergency.3=In emergency mode the set bonuses (Quantum: less knockback and cheaper damage absorbing, Exo: food from energy, the tools' bonuses with the set) and the armour chips don't work either. The gases' passives stay: heavy water against radiation, argon putting fires out.
