sc.armorfn.grav_press=Gravity press
sc.armorfn.grav_press.desc=On its key - every hostile mob within 6 blocks is pinned to the ground for 5 seconds: no walking, no jumping, flying ones come down. Helium 100 mB, deuterium 50 mB and 200 000 EU, heat +60, cooldown 30 seconds. A level 3 branch (the gravity grab is the other choice)
sc.armorfn.grav_grab=Gravity grab
sc.armorfn.grav_grab.desc=On its key - the mob or animal you look at (up to 8 blocks, not a player, not a boss) floats 3 blocks in front of you and follows your look. The key again (or after 6 seconds) throws it along your look. Helium 50 mB and 100 000 EU, cooldown 10 seconds after the throw. A level 3 branch (the gravity press is the other choice)
sc.armorfn.time_slow=Time slowing
sc.armorfn.time_slow.desc=On its key, for 6 seconds every living thing (but players) and every projectile not yours within 16 blocks moves about 5 times slower. Meanwhile the phase dash has no cooldown. Krypton 100 mB, helium 500 mB, Singular Matter 50 mB and 10% of the suit's charge, heat +200, cooldown 3 minutes. Drawback: hostile mobs within 48 blocks notice you
sc.armorfn.black_hole=Black hole
sc.armorfn.black_hole.desc=On its key a black hole opens for 10 seconds at the point you look at (the first block or 24 blocks): it pulls hostile mobs and items within 10 blocks, mobs near the centre take growing damage. At the end it collapses: a heavy blow to the mobs within 4 blocks, every item ends up at the point. No blocks are broken. Deuterium 500 mB, helium 1000 mB, Singular Matter 100 mB and 25% of the suit's charge, heat +300, cooldown 2 minutes. Drawback: hostile mobs within 48 blocks notice you. A level 5 branch (the gravity dome is the other choice)
sc.armorfn.grav_dome=Gravity dome
sc.armorfn.grav_dome.desc=On its key, for 8 seconds a dome of radius 5 rises round the spot you stand on: hostile mobs are pushed out, projectiles not yours stop at its edge. Helium 300 mB, deuterium 200 mB and 10% of the suit's charge, cooldown 2 minutes. A level 5 branch (the black hole is the other choice)
sc.armorfn.singularity=Singularity mode
sc.armorfn.singularity.desc=Needs all four Singular pieces. On its key, for 15 seconds the Singular functions are twice as strong: flight twice as fast, the event horizon turns 60% of damage into energy, the phase dash, the press and the black hole reach 1.5 times as far - but gas, energy and heat are doubled too. Then 60 seconds of weakness: all of it half as strong. Singular Matter 200 mB, deuterium 1000 mB and 20% of the suit's charge, heat +100, cooldown 10 minutes
sc.armorfn.resonance=Resonance
sc.armorfn.resonance.desc=Needs all four Singular pieces. With a running Singular Reactor or a switched-on, powered field generator within 16 blocks the suit feeds on it: +20 000 EU a second for the whole suit, heat -10 a second, helium +2 mB/s, deuterium +0.5 mB/s. Works overheated and without helium too. The source is looked for every 5 seconds
sc.armorfn.grav_scanner=Gravity scanner
sc.armorfn.grav_scanner.desc=Every 5 seconds a pulse: chests, spawners, ores (vanilla and this mod's) and mobs within 32 blocks show through walls for 5 seconds. Chests orange, spawners violet, ores yellow, the mod's ores cyan, hostile mobs red. At most 256 blocks and 64 mobs, chests and spawners first, then the nearest. Krypton 2 mB/min and 10 mB a pulse, 200 EU/s
sc.armorfn.threat_sense=Threat sense
sc.armorfn.threat_sense.desc=Mobs that target you (up to 32 blocks) are outlined red through walls, and red arrows at the screen's edge show where they come from. Krypton 0.5 mB/min, 20 EU/s
sc.armorfn.analyzer=Analyzer
sc.armorfn.analyzer.desc=Look at a mob (up to 16 blocks) or at this mod's machine, generator or storage (up to 8 blocks) - a small table appears next to the crosshair: for a mob its health, armour, damage and weaknesses (water, heat, undead, arthropod, fire-proof, explodes), for a machine its energy, status, progress and output. Krypton 1 mB and 1000 EU for each new target
