sc.manual.singular.fn.3=The heavy functions work on their keys (set in the K menu) and say in chat what's missing. Time slowing and the black hole set the hostile mobs within 48 blocks on you. Singularity mode doubles the functions' strength (and use) for 15 seconds, then for 60 seconds they're half as strong.
sc.manual.singular.fn.4=Branches: at level 3 the gravity press or the gravity grab, at level 5 the black hole or the gravity dome. Until a branch is chosen both its functions are locked; once the chestplate reaches level 3 (or 5), two choice buttons appear on its tab in the K menu - the first choice is free, later the branch can only be changed in the Singular Station (100 mB of SM). In creative mode both work.
