sc.singStation.tooltip=Levels up Singular armour, fills it with gases and charges it (SV)
sc.singStation.details=Everything the Armour Service Station does: 4 armour slots, 8 tanks (gases %d mB, singular matter %d mB), charging up to SV, filling the worn suit of whoever stands on top, modules, pipes, buckets. Modernisation: every ready piece at once (the full set 20%% cheaper), the resources drawn as it goes - without energy or gas it waits; "Cancel" gives half of what was drawn back. Branch change, level transfer, sync, colour scheme.
sc.singStation.details2=Gravitational Stabilisers nearby: +%d%% speed each (up to %d). A running Singular Reactor within 16 blocks: +%d%% speed and -%d%% EU.
sc.singStation.howto=Feed it SV energy (lower works too), switch it on and bring gases. Exo pieces in the armour slots + materials -> "Convert" (a level-1 Singular piece). Singular pieces: when a piece has full points and a task of its next level is done, press "Modernise"; 4 -> 5 needs a Singular Core in the catalyst slot. Placed switched off, dismantled with a wrench.
