sc.gravStabiliser.details=+%d%% modernisation speed each, up to %d count. A passive block, takes no energy. While the station works its orb glows and a beam runs to the rings.
sc.gravStabiliser.howto=Place it within %d blocks of the station horizontally, at its height (+-%d).
