sc.manual.generator.sing.smport=The matter goes only into a wall port tank that holds (or held) Singular Matter. An empty port won't take it: pour a bucket (or a cell) of SM into one first - the reactor finds the port within a second (the port remembers SM even after it empties). Until there is one, the matter gathers in the inner tank (WAILA will say so).
