sc.tooltip.singcrumb.details=Only the Singular drill's black hole mode gives them: one per %s natural blocks destroyed (an ore counts %s times). Blocks placed by players don't count, ordinary digging gives none. Nine crumbs make a singularity clot.
sc.tooltip.singcrumb.howto=Shift + right-click in the air with crumbs in hand and a Singular drill on the hotbar - the drill gets %s level points each (only as many as it needs are used).
sc.tooltip.singclot=Pressed singular matter
sc.tooltip.singclot.details=Nine singularity crumbs. The Matter Compressor in its liquid matter mode turns a clot into %s mB of singular matter at once.
sc.tooltip.singclot.howto=Crafted from 9 singularity crumbs. Goes into the Matter Compressor's input slot (in the capsule mode it waits).
