sc.bladefn.grav_pull=Gravity pull
sc.bladefn.grav_pull.desc=On its key only: the target you look at within 12 blocks is pulled to you and takes a blow (bosses only the blow). SM 5 mB, 8000 EU, cooldown 3 s
sc.bladefn.cascade=Cascade
sc.bladefn.cascade.desc=Hits in a row on one target: +10% each, up to +50% (Duelist: +80%). Another target or 3 s without a hit - from the start
sc.bladefn.sheath=Sheathed blade
sc.bladefn.sheath.desc=The blade switched off on the hotbar: +10% movement speed and a slow charge from the worn chestplate (1000 EU/s)
sc.bladefn.rift_step=Rift step
sc.bladefn.rift_step.desc=On its key only: a step behind the target within 16 blocks and a blow x1.5. SM 10 mB, 12000 EU, cooldown 8 s (Duelist, level 5: three in a row without a cooldown)
sc.bladefn.perfect_parry=Perfect parry
sc.bladefn.perfect_parry.desc=A hit within 0.3 s of raising the block does no damage, enemies around are slowed for 2 s, the next hit x2. Ar 20 mB
sc.bladefn.hunter_sense=Hunter's sense
sc.bladefn.hunter_sense.desc=Blade in hand: enemies within 32 blocks are outlined, seen through walls. Kr 2 mB/s
sc.bladefn.charged_strike=Charged strike
sc.bladefn.charged_strike.desc=Hold the block (right-click) 1.5 s until the sound and let go: the next hit within 5 s is x3 and throws the target about 10 blocks. Ar 15 mB a strike
sc.bladefn.event_horizon=Blade event horizon
sc.bladefn.event_horizon.desc=Blocking: projectiles within 3 blocks are swallowed; each gives +25% to the next wave (up to 8). He 10 mB a second of block
sc.bladefn.grav_shield=Gravity shield
sc.bladefn.grav_shield.desc=Blocking: a sphere of radius 3 pushes mobs away and turns projectiles back. He 15 mB a second of block (Guardian: the first 3 s of a block free)
sc.bladefn.chain_cut=Chain cut
sc.bladefn.chain_cut.desc=A hit jumps on to 3 more targets within 6 blocks of each other, each a quarter weaker. SM 5 mB a chain
sc.bladefn.riposte=Riposte
sc.bladefn.riposte.desc=The block took over 10 damage - the next hit within 5 s adds half of what it took
sc.bladefn.grav_tether=Gravity tether
sc.bladefn.grav_tether.desc=On its key only: for 5 s the target within 16 blocks can't get further than 6 blocks from you (not bosses). Kr 10 mB, 8000 EU, cooldown 12 s
sc.bladefn.form_attack=Form attack
sc.bladefn.form_attack.desc=On its key only: the current form's special attack - sword "Wave", scythe "Harvest", spear "Pierce", whip "Grab", shield "Ram", singular "Collapse"
sc.bladeform.sword.desc=A normal hit
sc.bladeform.scythe.desc=Hits everything in a 180° arc of 3 blocks, damage -20%
sc.bladeform.spear.desc=Reach +3 blocks, damage +20% on one target
sc.bladeform.whip.desc=Reach 7 blocks, damage -30%
sc.bladeform.shield.desc=Damage -50%, blocking costs no energy (the Guardian branch)
sc.bladeform.singular.desc=Damage x2, each hit spends 1 mB of singular matter (without it - like the sword)
sc.bladeform.sword.attack="Wave"
sc.bladeform.sword.attack.desc=The Exo energy wave, 16 blocks
sc.bladeform.scythe.attack="Harvest"
sc.bladeform.scythe.attack.desc=A spin: a full blow to everything within 4 blocks, thrown back. 15000 EU, cooldown 4 s
sc.bladeform.spear.attack="Pierce"
sc.bladeform.spear.attack.desc=A dash of 8 blocks through everything, a blow x1.2 to all on the way. 15000 EU, cooldown 5 s
sc.bladeform.whip.attack="Grab"
sc.bladeform.whip.attack.desc=Pull the target within 16 blocks, or with no target pull yourself to the block. 8000 EU, cooldown 3 s
sc.bladeform.shield.attack="Ram"
sc.bladeform.shield.attack.desc=A rush of 5 blocks, half a blow and a throw for all on the way. 15000 EU, cooldown 6 s
sc.bladeform.singular.attack="Collapse"
sc.bladeform.singular.attack.desc=For 2 s pulls everything within 8 (Destroyer, level 5: 12) to a point ahead, then a blast that breaks no blocks. SM 50 mB, 40000 EU, cooldown 30 s
