sc.tooltip.drill.sing.hole=The black hole destroys everything in the zone, no drops: EU x0.5 a block, SM 1 mB per %s blocks, 12x12: a %s s cooldown.
sc.tooltip.drill.sing.crumbinfo=In the "Black hole" mode - a singularity crumb per %s natural blocks (an ore counts %s). A level point per %s blocks dug in any mode.
sc.tooltip.drill.sing.controls=Shift + wheel: off - 5x5 - 5x5 tunnel - 9x9 ... (what the level opens). Shift + right-click in the air - depth 1 / 3. Replacement takes the block from the slot right of the drill. Phase dig - on its own key (K, the "Drill" tab).
sc.toolbranch.drill.1.desc=Miner: lv 3 - digs 25% faster, the 12x12 black hole has no cooldown; lv 5 - an 11x11 gravitational funnel.
sc.toolbranch.drill.2.desc=Prospector: lv 3 - the phase dig reaches 12 blocks; lv 5 - fortune VI and veins up to 256 blocks.
